  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vrijwillige geoormerkte bijdrage aan IOM in het kader van de IOM Flash Appeal for Ukraine and Neighbouring Countries</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Vrijwillige geoormerkte bijdrage aan IOM in het kader van de IOM Flash Appeal for Ukraine and Neighbouring Countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM proposes to provide 5,079 conflict-affected households (20,316 individuals) in Kyiv Oblast with construction materials for self-driven repairs with guidance from IOM&#x2019;s technical teams. In addition, IOM aims to strengthen prevention of sexual exploitation and abuse (PSEA) and respond to the incidents that can occur during the Ukraine Crisis, as well as support the inter-agency collective response in Ukraine.  Ondersteuning van het cre&#xeb;ren en garanderen van duuurzame oplossingen voor bescherming en opvang voor de bevolking die door het conflict in Oekra&#xef;ne getroffen zijn</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to contribute to safe and dignified living conditions for conflict-affected communities in Ukraine&#x2019;s Kyiv Oblast through individual, cash-based, or direct implementation shelter support.</narrative>
  </description>
